{
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Direct objects",
      "body": "The direct object is the thing or person that receives the action: in *Compro el pan* (I buy the bread), the object is *el pan*. To avoid repeating it, replace it with a pronoun: *Lo compro* (I buy it).",
      "table": {
        "head": [
          "",
          "Pronoun",
          "Example"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "me",
            "*me*",
            "*Ana me llama.* — Ana calls me."
          ],
          [
            "you (tú)",
            "*te*",
            "*Te veo mañana.* — I'll see you tomorrow."
          ],
          [
            "him / it (masc.) / you (usted, masc.)",
            "*lo*",
            "*¿El libro? Lo leo.* — I read it."
          ],
          [
            "her / it (fem.) / you (usted, fem.)",
            "*la*",
            "*¿La camisa? La compro.* — I'll buy it."
          ],
          [
            "us",
            "*nos*",
            "*Nos invitan.* — They invite us."
          ],
          [
            "them / you all (masc.)",
            "*los*",
            "*¿Los zapatos? Los necesito.*"
          ],
          [
            "them / you all (fem.)",
            "*las*",
            "*¿Las llaves? No las encuentro.*"
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "heading": "Where the pronoun goes",
      "body": "- Before a conjugated verb: *Lo quiero.* (I want it.) *No la conozco.* (I don't know her.)\n- With an infinitive or *ir a* + infinitive, you can put it before the first verb **or** attach it to the infinitive: *La voy a llamar* = *Voy a llamarla* (I'm going to call her). *Lo quiero ver* = *Quiero verlo*.\n\n*Lo / la / los / las* must match the noun they replace: *¿Tienes las llaves? — Sí, las tengo.*"
    },
    {
      "heading": "The personal a",
      "body": "When the direct object is a specific person (or a beloved pet), put *a* in front of it: *Veo a María. Llamo a mi madre. Busco a mi perro.* No *a* for things: *Veo la casa.* And no *a* after *tener*: *Tengo dos hermanos.*"
    }
  ],
